# Untitled

Selectively patterned \(\mathrm{TiO}_{2}\) nanorods as electron transport pathway for high performance perovskite solar cells
Daihong Huh\(^{1,\S}\), KyoungSuk Oh\(^{1,2,\S}\), Minjin Kim\(^{1,2,\S}\), Hak-Jong Choi\(^{1,3}\), Dong Suk Kim\(^{2}\) (✉), and Heon Lee\(^{1}\) (✉)
